-- Showcase Level 3 (design sum-type-showcase): userspace `observe` with a
-- continuous base and an inequality predicate -- a truncated Normal. The kept
-- arm is a dim-1 density restricted to the positive half-line; the rejected arm
-- is the dim-0 mass of the complement, measured through the CDF by the
-- set-valued witness machinery (design set-valued-witnesses).
--
-- `p(Right ANY)` (= P(Just ANY) = 0.5) is NOT queried here: structural MAR
-- inside a constructor slot of a *continuous* comparison target is the known
-- open gap of observe-partials-umbrella. It crashes rather than answering, so
-- it graduates into this .tst when that gap closes.
main = let v = Normal in if v > 0.0 then right v else left ()
